{"voice":"kokoro/af_heart","clips":[{"i":0,"text":"Hi, I’m Sahnawaz — a full-stack developer and UI designer from Assam. Everything on this site is hand-coded, with no templates. Let me show you around in about a minute.","file":"step-1-7289a5e7.mp3","seconds":12.86,"bytes":64557,"words":[[0.625,0.925],[0.975,1.188],[1.188,2.0],[1.188,2.0],[2.075,2.2],[2.2,2.8],[2.8,3.413],[3.413,3.587],[3.587,4.025],[4.025,4.525],[4.525,4.675],[4.675,5.55],[5.712,6.225],[6.225,6.387],[6.387,6.562],[6.562,6.875],[6.875,7.025],[7.025,7.875],[7.975,8.15],[8.15,8.35],[8.35,9.3],[9.438,9.588],[9.588,9.75],[9.75,10.0],[10.0,10.15],[10.15,10.575],[10.575,10.725],[10.725,10.963],[10.963,11.025],[11.025,11.625]],"env":"","fps":25},{"i":1,"text":"These are my live products: YojanaSahay, a free government-scheme finder used across India, StudyLens AI for students, and this website. Just below, live numbers come straight from both apps.","file":"step-2-e3e0b669.mp3","seconds":14.57,"bytes":73077,"words":[[0.65,0.925],[0.925,1.012],[1.012,1.175],[1.175,1.425],[1.425,2.325],[2.438,3.525],[3.663,3.8],[3.8,4.112],[4.112,4.938],[4.938,5.387],[5.387,5.662],[5.662,6.0],[6.0,6.65],[6.787,7.512],[7.512,7.975],[7.975,8.1],[8.1,8.675],[8.762,8.9],[8.9,9.1],[9.1,9.975],[10.15,10.425],[10.425,10.875],[10.987,11.312],[11.312,11.65],[11.65,11.875],[11.875,12.225],[12.225,12.425],[12.425,12.7],[12.7,13.325]],"env":"","fps":25},{"i":2,"text":"This is how I ship. Every change goes through GitHub, is built automatically, and goes live in about a minute, with one-click rollback.","file":"step-3-52447b96.mp3","seconds":10.06,"bytes":50517,"words":[[0.625,0.8],[0.8,0.95],[0.95,1.2],[1.2,1.375],[1.375,2.05],[2.212,2.538],[2.538,3.0],[3.0,3.275],[3.275,3.475],[3.475,4.1],[4.2,4.35],[4.35,4.637],[4.637,5.575],[5.675,5.8],[5.8,6.15],[6.15,6.45],[6.45,6.562],[6.562,6.787],[6.787,6.85],[6.85,7.3],[7.4,7.587],[7.587,8.05],[8.05,8.825]],"env":"00000011222233333993697357899988886666753333222222222222199779954689999999644998